    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tlkt](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tlkt) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 18 2026 72km S of Tello. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -0.6858 longitude 98.416. It impacted 10895 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
